Problem URL - https://leetcode.com/problems/game-play-analysis-i/description/

SOLUTION - 

/* Write your T-SQL query statement below */

SELECT player_id, MIN(event_date) AS "first_login"
FROM Activity
GROUP BY player_id 



Pyspark solution  - 
from pyspark.sql.types import *
from pyspark.sql.functions import *
from pyspark.sql.window import Window
from pyspark.sql import SparkSession


spark = SparkSession.builder.appName("Game Play Analysis I").getOrCreate()

df_result = df_activity.groupBy("player_id")\
                    .agg(min("event_date").alias("first_login"))\
                    .select("player_id", "first_login")